{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4000_place", "source_sha256": "952fa1ea873e03298eb9b8970fb7441fa49177ad5cf087fbb5eed809678638bb", "ja": "TV局スタジオ袖", "zh": "电视台摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4001_050jul", "source_sha256": "a30ac9da777ab7b9883d2b163c5d21d16ab9dda96a7c7c68c5d58970e9856317", "ja": "うわ……なんかスタジオ中、\nあっちもこっちもアイドルだらけだな……。", "zh": "哇……摄影棚里\n到处都是偶像啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4002_p", "source_sha256": "07e495eb95a1653b3712fa740b025c20c2dc4bf4beecceb209f249188194979b", "ja": "アイドル特番だからな。この人数の中で目立つのは、\nなかなか大変だけど……ジュリア、いけそうか？", "zh": "因为是偶像特别节目啊，要在这么多人当中\n吸引观众目光很不容易……茱莉亚，你有信心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4003_050jul", "source_sha256": "0b38229e8585ae930333e62f276949decce3d84b3806f89bbb2033360bdcb91d", "ja": "目立つ……目立つか……うーん……。", "zh": "吸引目光……吸引目光吗……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4004_050jul", "source_sha256": "8185442e680e4ece4bec36f687888cfb1a86548458e99300bf8bf29e8c777e57", "ja": "あたしは、「休日は何をしていますか」って\n質問にフリップで答えることになってるんだけど……。", "zh": "我的部分是要在白板上写下\n「假日会做些什么？」这个问题的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4005_050jul", "source_sha256": "24c61ac0731f6f8b5df66b31b587da19dc487fb484487e32c4af63518fdfdabc", "ja": "「これ！」っていう答えが見つからなくてさ。\nどう書けばいいと思う？　{$P$}。", "zh": "但实在想不到让人耳目一新的答案。\n{$P$}，你觉得写什么比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4006", "source_sha256": "f1d43342e22f28d80338f9e9a74f58f6a1a88803da72b03eb8b093f35214f798", "ja": "正直に書く", "zh": "诚实回答", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4007", "source_sha256": "17280fc6e75568e6e1ef3ed2fd04da6c6a910c6a6fd247f973958dda7ca3b51f", "ja": "笑いをとりにいく", "zh": "试着搞笑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4008", "source_sha256": "299cede1251e23ffa17f3155a3185ff036551f3338f49ab80a66c81040bfc467", "ja": "アイドルらしく！", "zh": "偶像风格的答案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4100_p", "source_sha256": "05be33f5f299c16f1b1eece88d5e34815ae14799e4cefba19292ba059a065164", "ja": "そこは、正直に書くべきじゃないか？\nみんなにジュリアのことを知ってもらうチャンスだ！", "zh": "这时候应该要诚实回答吧？\n这是让大家更了解茱莉亚的机会啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4101_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab49875b6e83f37d9d495b269ba23e82ce902b95c89d207b8a6e1d131289b8f1", "ja": "正直に……か。ギターを弾いたり、\n作曲したりって、なんか地味じゃないか？", "zh": "诚实回答……吗？但是弹吉他、\n作曲之类的，会不会太普通了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4102_050jul", "source_sha256": "0eab38b97fb016658d85969021fd59746d247780b4fc8919a64fb9eef61ddae6", "ja": "あたし以外のみんなは、もっとアイドルらしい、\nカワイイ答えを用意してるんじゃ……。", "zh": "除了我以外的人，应该都准备了\n更像偶像、更可爱的答案吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4103_p", "source_sha256": "d58235a0f72b0c1597ace685cdc51b65fd4ae91bed92c0c275fe8fafc1783d96", "ja": "そんなことない、クールでジュリアらしいよ。\nいいと思う、それでいこう！", "zh": "没这回事，这很酷且很有茱莉亚的风格喔。\n我觉得这样很好，就这么写吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4104_050jul", "source_sha256": "09e696dcf7c45c18cf11d87556f59e98aac827ed469f80ecd5654f09a2a444aa", "ja": "確かに、あたしはあたしだからな……。\nわかった、正直に答えることにするよ。", "zh": "的确，毕竟我就是我……\n我知道了，我会诚实回答的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4105_050jul", "source_sha256": "a051e3008d52a51ebd910197bfdcae7fe4c37aea6bdc3d603d9099c6e951af78", "ja": "サンキュ、{$P$}！\nあんたに聞いて正解だったよ♪", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}！\n问你真是问对了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4200_p", "source_sha256": "ff020168228bdb8a4b2f584b81bad1df6c77df592159cdc158a1b1cd25eff801", "ja": "よし、この人数だ。\n目立つために、笑いをとりにいこう！", "zh": "好，既然有这么多人，\n为了吸引目光，就试着搞笑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4201_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e36ba1d1648f5659685ba0cd104853dbcd9b4e4c12946f33b36ae177ac2c131", "ja": "わ……笑い？　笑いって、どうやってとるんだ……？\n確かに、目立つにはいいと思うけどさ。", "zh": "搞……搞笑？要怎么搞笑……？\n虽然应该会很引人注目没错啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4202_050jul", "source_sha256": "695dcf3a9f702339cdf33bf74268c1131f6376dd5844a2e2330a695fab67d363", "ja": "アイドルってのは、笑いもとれないといけないのか……\n難しい仕事なんだな……。", "zh": "当偶像也非搞笑不可吗……\n这工作还真难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4300_p", "source_sha256": "d6a1e78ea9c01feb98628bbc71bdb770cd6cb040d5ff4afc4dd48335914c7dd9", "ja": "超アイドルっぽい答えはどうだ？\nこう、可愛くて胸キュンな感じのやつだ！", "zh": "超像偶像的回答怎么样？\n就是很可爱、会令人怦然心动的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4301_050jul", "source_sha256": "0810d0c4149c4a5c4ad66814acd86db37c631051ab0c8206368b1536d22ed1d4", "ja": "お、おう……。\nカワいくて胸キュンか……う、うーん……。", "zh": "喔、喔……\n可爱、令人怦然心动吗……呃、呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_4302_050jul", "source_sha256": "64cc2ddb8b2d56f9530c45a0ed2f2494e2c60a46519c1ccc1a413ae8bbd16bd5", "ja": "じ、じゃあ、スイーツの食べ歩きとか、か……？\n女の子っぽいし、悪い結果にはならない……よな……？", "zh": "那、那么，要回答甜点巡礼之类的吗……？\n很女孩子气，结果应该不会太差……吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
